### Login unknown user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "unknown@example.com",
  "password": "unknown"
}

### Login without email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "password"
}

### Login without password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}